pub fn rename(dir: &Path, old_id: &str, new_id: &str, new_title: &str) -> std::io::Result<()>
```

**How it works:**
1. Reads the note file at `<old_id>.note`
2. Parses its content (id, title, pinned, body) using the `SEP` delimiter
